### 622-presign-upload-rejected-mime.http — [usecase-test] CASE-02. 허용되지 않는 MIME 타입은 presign 거부 (#622)
###
### PresignedUploadRequest#contentType 은 `^image/(jpeg|png|webp|gif)$` 로 제한된다(Bean Validation) —
### 이미지가 아닌 MIME(text/html)으로 요청하면 400으로 거부되는지 확인한다.

### 1. CREATOR1 회원가입
< {%
    client.global.set("file622Email", "file622-" + Date.now() + "@earlybird.co.kr");
%}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{file622Email}}",
  "password": "rawPassword1!",
  "name": "파일테스트CREATOR2",
  "phoneNumber": "010-2000-0002"
}

> {%
    client.test("회원가입 성공", function() { client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body); });
%}

### 2. 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{file622Email}}",
  "password": "rawPassword1!"
}

> {%
    client.test("로그인 성공", function() { client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body); });
    client.global.set("file622AccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 3. 허용되지 않는 MIME(text/html)으로 presign 요청 — 400 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files/presigned-upload
Authorization: Bearer {{file622AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "originalName": "x.html"
}

> {%
    client.test("400 Bad Request (Bean Validation)", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 400, "expected 400, got " + response.status + ": " + response.body);
    });
%}
